you do have the choice to say no.

00:31:08.040 --> 00:31:11.140
Um, but, uh, you should, you should probably fight the monster

00:31:11.140 --> 00:31:12.860
unless you're, like, really low on health or something.

00:31:13.140 --> 00:31:15.260
These monster battles, I understand,

00:31:15.440 --> 00:31:18.280
Sean, the disconnect when I was describing the game that it's a fighting game.

00:31:18.420 --> 00:31:19.580
It's not, but I thought

00:31:19.580 --> 00:31:22.200
that was, like, the most apt way to describe it visually.

00:31:22.940 --> 00:31:26.720
However, these, these fighting, you know,

00:31:26.820 --> 00:31:32.700
you versus the monster thing, I feel like they couldn't have tried any less to make these actual

