kaiju battles fun and exhilarating and feel like big, massive fights where, like, you punch this guy

00:31:40.560 --> 00:31:45.040
and he gets blown back or falls down and he punches you and then you're down.

00:31:45.240 --> 00:31:46.300
Instead, it just happens

