00:37:47.060 --> 00:38:00.700
Like, for instance, if you put in destroy all monsters with spaces between the words in, uh, in password, that will create a unique board where you can fight all the final monsters.

00:38:01.520 --> 00:38:02.880
Oh, I didn't see that one.

00:38:03.160 --> 00:38:09.240
It's just you and all the monsters on one board and, um, you know, not, not too many hexagon tiles between you and them.

00:38:09.560 --> 00:38:11.120
Oh, oh, oh, on a board.

