Yeah. I did see that one, yeah.

00:38:42.220 --> 00:38:43.980
The, the debug mode for that one.

00:38:44.340 --> 00:38:52.760
Uh, the same kind of debug thing happens if you just leave the password blank and hit, like, you know, end to move on to the next thing.

00:38:52.940 --> 00:38:55.000
It takes you to a level without monsters.

00:38:55.680 --> 00:38:59.280
Oh. It's funny because I feel like that's something that you would easily stumble upon.

00:38:59.760 --> 00:39:00.940
Yeah. Right, right.

00:39:00.980 --> 00:39:03.460
That's how you start knowing, like, oh, I should try passwords.

00:39:03.740 --> 00:39:08.020
Like, I imagine what happens when, I haven't put a password in yet and this is happening.

00:39:08.080 --> 00:39:09.900
Imagine what happens when I start putting in passwords.

00:39:09.900 --> 00:39:13.800
They also have, uh, little abbreviations for each planet.

