So, like, for Jupiter, J-U-P, for Mars, M-A-R.

00:39:18.320 --> 00:39:28.380
If you just put in those three letter digit codes for each planet, that creates a, it starts you off in that particular planet, but at level one.

00:39:28.620 --> 00:39:34.260
So, if you want, like, a real challenge, you just do U-R-A and you're in Uranus at level one.

00:39:34.780 --> 00:39:36.300
Uh-huh. Hmm.

00:39:36.920 --> 00:39:38.100
Yeah. Butts.

00:39:38.100 --> 00:39:44.560
Get good. Uh, also, uh, there's a sound test mode if you put in sound as the password.

