Go figure. Also, there's a Godzilla game on Game Boy that I own, and I don't really remember, but it involves, like, also Godzilla's son, which just...

00:46:40.440 --> 00:46:41.340
Come on.

00:46:41.900 --> 00:46:42.760
Godzilla's son?

00:46:43.000 --> 00:46:44.640
Like, let's get out of this.

00:46:45.000 --> 00:46:51.320
There's Godzilla Destroy All Monsters Melee, which I have to reference, because that is a good Godzilla fighting game.

00:46:51.440 --> 00:46:58.200
Now, that was on, I think, GameCube, PS2, Xbox 360, or original Xbox, I suppose.

00:46:58.700 --> 00:47:01.380
